'''Chroma Fire Bat''' is a [[Chroma Fire Pets|Chroma Fire Pet]] that can be obtained by hatching it from the [[Common Egg|common egg]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Chroma Fire Bat has the same appearance as the [[Fire Bat]], but the pet alternates colors chromatically.

== Trivia ==
*This item is the [[Chroma Fire Pets|chroma]] version of [[Fire Bat]], or the Chroma Fire version of [[Bat]].

